Rāvaṇa finds Marutta sacrificing with gods --- Gods hide as peacock crow chameleon swan --- Rāvaṇa demands war or surrender --- Marutta scorns brother-beating boast and arms --- Saṃvarta forbids war during Mahēśvara session --- Marutta drops bow and resumes rite --- Śuka proclaims Rāvaṇa victor as he devours sages --- Gods grant peacock eyes swan whiteness crow safety chameleon gold
